        "commit_message": "vim-patch:9.2.1191: crash with \"//e\" when only a substitute pattern exists\n\nProblem:  Crash when using \"//e\" or \"//\" while there is a substitute\n          pattern but no previous search pattern (after v9.2.0374).\nSolution: Use the previous pattern selected for an empty pattern\n          (Jonas Ornfelt).\n\nrelated: vim/vim#19998\ncloses:  vim/vim#21533\n\nAI-assisted\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/c58607c9a0579de0da909fc46f68144a01378af1",
        "commit_title": "fix(search): crash on \"//e\" with only a substitute pattern (#42345)",
