    "body": "Problem:\nAfter `:s/a/b/` with no previous search pattern, `//e<CR>` or `//<CR>`\nin Normal mode crashes Nvim. Since 8efe4f9ac1 (#39097),\nparse_search_pattern_offset() makes \"searchstr\" empty for an empty\npattern, so the search message uses spats[0].pat, which is NULL.\n\nSolution:\nUse the previous pattern selected for an empty pattern, like before.\n\nVim has the same code since 9.2.0374.\n",
